Public Works Director
 Description
Three phase project to double size of the existing facility to accommodate current and future waste disposal needs.  Phase I is complete which
replaced the fuel tanks, added the Household Hazardous Waste Facility and did site work in preparation for Phases II and III.  Phase II remodels
tipping areas, adds safety training room, and expands office space.  Phase III adds second tipping floor and separates residential from commercial
customers to significantly improve on-site safety.
